  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, Squadron Commander; or Warleader sphere, Troop Commander.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The number of members of your squadron increases. Your squadron includes yourself and 4 allies plus an additional ally for every 2 caster levels or ranks in Diplomacy (whichever is higher) you possess. You may add troop or crew creatures to your squadron, with each counting as 4 creatures.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/squadron-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
